# The whole fee computation, over a one-item trip

> Module AirlineTrip

> Using AirlineWorld as W
> Using Airline as A

A concolic harness for the whole fee computation, included in the generator's
default target set now that CUTECat can symbolically execute bounded lists.

`Airline.Trip` takes a `W.Itinerary`, whose `items` field is a list. The scope
builds a one-item itinerary from scalar symbolic inputs. List construction,
mapping, filtering, concatenation and folding are now retained symbolically,
so the gazetteer, fee tables, allowance and acceptance branches remain visible
to the concolic path search. A directly symbolic `W.Itinerary` input is still
outside the current implementation because its list is nested inside a struct.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope FullTrip:
  input origin content W.City
  input destination content W.City
  input cabin content W.Cabin
  input ticket content money
  input status_at_ticketing content W.EliteStatus
  input status_at_checkin content W.EliteStatus
  input cardmember content boolean
  input military content W.MilitaryStatus
  input flagship content boolean
  input children content integer
  ## The single item is spread out because list values nested inside a symbolic
  ## structure input are not yet materialised recursively.
  input kind content W.ItemKind
  input length content integer
  input width content integer
  input height content integer
  input weight content integer

  internal trip content A.Trip
  output base_fees content money
  output excess_fees content money
  output total content money
  output accepted content boolean
```

```catala
scope FullTrip:
  definition trip equals
    output of A.Trip with { -- itinerary: W.Itinerary {
      -- origin: origin
      -- destination: destination
      -- cabin: cabin
      -- ticket: ticket
      -- items: [W.Item {
           -- kind: kind
           -- length: length
           -- width: width
           -- height: height
           -- weight: weight
         }]
      -- status_at_ticketing: status_at_ticketing
      -- status_at_checkin: status_at_checkin
      -- cardmember: cardmember
      -- military: military
      -- flagship: flagship
      -- children: children
    } }

  definition base_fees equals trip.base_fees
  definition excess_fees equals trip.excess_fees
  definition total equals trip.total_cost
  definition accepted equals trip.accepted
```
